      en: ["Colonial residence in Cap-Haïtien.", "Located on the western half of the Caribbean island of Hispaniola, in the Republic of Haiti.", "Tropical climate with wet and dry seasons; the country lies in the Atlantic hurricane belt (June-November).", "Port-au-Prince, the capital, is Haiti's political, economic and cultural hub."]
